# ProofRoom response headers.
#
# Origin-Agent-Cluster keeps this origin in its own agent cluster.
# Permissions-Policy is deliberately not used to restrict `tools`, because a
# restrictive tools policy disables WebMCP tool registration for this page.

/*
  Origin-Agent-Cluster: ?1
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
